```console
$ scherzo-cloud project repository list --help
List repositories selected for a GitHub installation

Usage: scherzo-cloud project repository list [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <INSTALLATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <INSTALLATION>  GitHub installation binding ID

Options:
      --json                           Print the project result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
